  },
  "scope_notes": "Clean documentation cherry-picks to the 31.x release branch; the metadata indicates 5 files and 5 commits (+21/-9) despite the full diff against branch point showing older history.",
  "changed_since_previous": "Added the backport of #36441 (commit 655cf21b8c), which fixes #36431 by updating the 'How to Upgrade' instructions for the bitcoin wrapper and libexec directory.",
  "card": "This pull request backports documentation changes from #36309, #36377, and #36441 to the 31.x release branch for milestone 31.2. It marks private transaction broadcast as experimental and reframes its guarantees as risk reduction, adds BIP 461 to bips.md, and updates the upgrade guide to instruct users to copy both bin/ and libexec/ to prevent stale multiprocess binaries. All included pull requests have already been merged into master.",
